WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,020
Just now, the trading platform suddenly launched a lot of things that were not available before.

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:05,020
There is a lot of glass and a lot of drawings

3
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:08,020
Things that didn't exist before suddenly appear in large quantities

4
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:10,180
It should have come from the smiling eyes today.

5
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:12,560
It seems that there is indeed a group of people who know how to coordinate tactics.

6
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,560
A powerful owner with talented combinations

7
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,750
How can I kill the enhanced Smiling Eyes so quickly?

8
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:19,780
He is definitely much stronger than Uncle Xu’s group of wild men.

9
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:20,780
I put the glass in my backpack

10
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:21,780
You upgrade your windows first

11
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:23,780
I continue to stare at the trading platform

12
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:25,780
There will definitely be some good stuff on the shelves today

13
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:27,780
Good Butler Jiang

14
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:31,320
Materials have been met. Do you want to upgrade?

15
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:35,250
In the past two days, no smiling eyes have attacked from the window.

16
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:37,310
It's a monster that can't fly

17
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:39,310
Or is it because of other mechanisms?

18
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:40,310
If it's the former, of course it's better

19
00:00:40,310 --> 00:00:43,310
But it’s always right to take precautions before they happen, brother.

20
00:00:43,310 --> 00:00:44,310
I decided

21
00:00:44,310 --> 00:00:45,310
Give it a try

22
00:00:45,310 --> 00:00:48,500
But can we discuss this further?

23
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:49,500
We have someone here

24
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,500
Otherwise, we will be eight years and two

25
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,500
After all we're going out on an adventure
